Traditionally, data center operators have recommended an ambient temperature of 18 to 27 degrees Celsius (approximately 64 to 80 degrees Fahrenheit) for data center equipment. But in an unexpected twist, Nvidia's new 100% liquid-cooled AI data centers are running at a feverish temperature of 45 degrees Celsius (113 degrees Fahrenheit). This may seem counterintuitive, but Nvidia asserts that this c
